  unitName: Raid Bolt Fennia
  unitId: 840005
  unitNumber: 8011
  description: Found by the maidens on her journey, she was crushed by the aftershock
    from regaining her memories. In that instant, a prophecy was revealed in her
    fortune-telling on the path to defeating the unrelenting gods. With a new lease
    of redemption, she swore on the death of millions that she would never let another
    soul falter in the jurisdication of her powers.
  summonDesc: I wanna save the people!<br>You too? Yippie!<br>I'll help you, but
    watch out for my bombs!
  fusionDesc: Oooh the bolts are <br>sparking in my veins!<br>Zappy zap zap!
  evoDesc: Alas... fortune favors the brave.<br>Who will win the war, you ask?<br>That's
    a secret!
